        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bantu boonse bakabungana camoyo omwe kumugwagwa uuli kunembo lyamulyango wamaanzi. Nkabela bakaambila Ezara mulembi kuti alete ibbuku lyamulao wa-Musa, Jehova ngwaakalailila ba-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
