                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Ezara mupaizi wakaleta mulao kumeso aabantu boonse babungene, baalumi abanakazi aboonse ibakakonzya kuswiililisya, mubuzuba butaanzi bwamwezi wamusanu aibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakabala majwi aawo kunembo lyamugwagwa uuli kunembo lyamulyango wamaanzi kuzwa kucifumofumo kusikila isikati, kubusyu bwabantu boonse, baalumi abanakazi aboonse ibakakonzya kumvwa, nkabela matwi aabantu boonse akayandisya kumvwa majwi aabbuku lyamulao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezara mulembi wakaliimvwi aciimikilo cazisamu ncibakacitila makani aya ngaonya, alimwi kubbazu lyakwe kwakaima Matitiya a-Sema a-Anaya a-Uriya a-Hilikiya a-Maaseya, kujanza lyakwe lyalulyo, akujanza lyakwe lyalumwensi Pedaya a-Misayeli a-Malikiya a-Hasumu a-Hasibadana a-Zekariya a-Mesulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
