        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Nehemiya, ngonguwe mweendelezi, a-Ezara mupaizi mulembi aba-Levi ibakaiisya bantu bakaambila bantu boonse kuti, Buzuba obuno mbuzuba busalalisya bwa-Jeheva Leza wanu, Mutoomokinikuba kulila pe. Nkaambo bantu boonse bakali kulila nibakamvwa majwi aamulao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
